      "Calgary and Edmonton have absorbed faster population growth at flatter ratios. Annual frequency; v1 ships with the methodology note on " +
      "base year and intercensal interpolation.",
    source:
      "Statistics Canada Tables 17-10-0135 (CMA population) and 36-10-0688 (housing stock).",
  },
